WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.062 --> 00:00:06.926
The Demon of Black Rain and the mountain's spirit gathered weapons.

2
00:00:06.927 --> 00:00:09.747
Suddenly the demon stopped and stared at her.

3
00:00:09.748 --> 00:00:15.743
"Why are you helping me, Spirit? I didn't think you liked me."

4
00:00:15.744 --> 00:00:20.420
"I like you a lot," the spirit said.

5
00:00:20.421 --> 00:00:24.606
"But I took over your mountain," the demon said.

6
00:00:24.607 --> 00:00:33.667
"Yes," the spirit said, "but you take very good care of it. I appreciate that.

7
00:00:33.668 --> 00:00:40.917
Besides, the goddess is really powerful, so you'll need my help."

8
00:00:40.918 --> 00:00:45.257
"Bah!" The demon waved a hand.

9
00:00:45.258 --> 00:00:48.831
"I'm not worried about that goddess.

10
00:00:48.832 --> 00:00:56.526
She's not as powerful as Swift Wing said."

11
00:00:56.527 --> 00:01:00.946
"I disagree," the spirit said.

12
00:01:00.947 --> 00:01:05.929
"I heard that she can shoot fire from her eyes."

13
00:01:05.930 --> 00:01:10.696
"Everyone can do that," the demon said.

14
00:01:10.697 --> 00:01:20.378
"She can fly," the spirit added, "and she has super breath that can blow demons away.

15
00:01:20.379 --> 00:01:28.246
She has so much super strength, she could probably lift this entire mountain."

16
00:01:28.247 --> 00:01:31.831
A bead of sweat dripped down the side of the demon's head.

17
00:01:31.832 --> 00:01:34.929
He quickly wiped it away and puffed out his chest.

18
00:01:34.930 --> 00:01:42.814
"Well, I have my magic rain power, and nobody can stop that!"

19
00:01:42.815 --> 00:01:49.122
He tapped his chin. "I hope she can't freeze rain, but otherwise I'm not worried . . . "

20
00:01:49.123 --> 00:01:55.292
Light sparkled in the cave, and the mountain's spirit transformed into Rocket Girl.

21
00:01:55.293 --> 00:02:00.397
The demon's eyes went wide. "You!"

22
00:02:00.398 --> 00:02:04.974
"The mountain's spirit made me look like her!" Roxy grinned.

23
00:02:04.975 --> 00:02:09.352
"Grr!" The demon charged toward Roxy.

24
00:02:09.353 --> 00:02:14.840
Pow! Roxy knocked him down, and then she leaped up, ready to attack.

25
00:02:14.841 --> 00:02:20.085
A strong wind whipped through the cave, throwing Roxy into a wall.

26
00:02:20.086 --> 00:02:22.543
Rain swirled around the demon.

27
00:02:22.544 --> 00:02:26.874
Whoo-oo-oosh! Roxy blew her freeze breath.

28
00:02:26.875 --> 00:02:30.964
The rain froze, encasing the demon in ice.

29
00:02:30.965 --> 00:02:35.038
He twisted and turned, struggling to break free.

30
00:02:35.039 --> 00:02:37.510
The mountain's spirit appeared.

31
00:02:37.511 --> 00:02:42.072
"You must be quick, Rocket Girl!" she cried.

32
00:02:42.073 --> 00:02:48.859
"The demon's rain won't stay frozen for long!" The spirit vanished.

33
00:02:48.860 --> 00:02:55.232
"So long, Demon," Roxy said, running down a long hallway toward a heavy door.

34
00:02:55.233 --> 00:03:02.150
Bam! She kicked the door down, and inside the room were the prisoners.

35
00:03:02.151 --> 00:03:06.879
"You're the Tang Monk, right?" Roxy asked as she untied the ropes.

36
00:03:06.880 --> 00:03:14.030
"Don't tell her anything, Master!" Wujing said. "She might be a demon!"

37
00:03:14.031 --> 00:03:17.890
"I'm not a demon," Roxy said, rolling her eyes.

38
00:03:17.891 --> 00:03:24.702
"I'm here to save you." She finished untying the monk and then worked on Wujing's ropes.

39
00:03:24.703 --> 00:03:28.192
The Tang Monk watched her carefully.

40
00:03:28.193 --> 00:03:36.392
"Yes," he said finally. "I'm the Tang Monk, and that is my companion, Sha Wujing."

41
00:03:36.393 --> 00:03:38.902
Soon Wujing was free.

42
00:03:38.903 --> 00:03:46.407
"It's nice to meet you," Roxy said. "I'm Rocket Girl. We have to go—quickly!"

43
00:03:46.408 --> 00:03:49.739
The three of them hurried out of the cave.

44
00:03:49.740 --> 00:03:55.790
They rushed down the side of the mountain, jumping over shrubs.

45
00:03:55.791 --> 00:04:00.902
A horse appeared alongside them and allowed the Tang Monk to hop on its back.

46
00:04:00.903 --> 00:04:04.413
"Is that your horse?" Roxy asked.

47
00:04:04.414 --> 00:04:11.451
The Tang Monk nodded. "He's another one of my companions."

48
00:04:11.452 --> 00:04:15.272
"It's actually a dragon," Wujing said.

49
00:04:15.273 --> 00:04:19.218
"This place is strange," Roxy said, shaking her head.

50
00:04:19.219 --> 00:04:25.852
Before long everyone was off the mountain, but then the sky rumbled.

51
00:04:25.853 --> 00:04:30.867
Everyone turned around to see dark, evil-looking clouds forming.

52
00:04:30.868 --> 00:04:34.269
Wind began to whip down the mountain's slope.

53
00:04:34.270 --> 00:04:39.987
Roxy gulped. "Uh-oh!"

